# Per-client, one-off deploy playbooks (throwaway; pasted into a client-rooted window). Keep local only.
# Moved under deploy/<client>/ in the 2026-07 root cleanup — old root paths kept
# so an older working copy doesn't suddenly start tracking them.
# Pattern, so a new dated playbook isn't accidentally tracked. deploy/README.md
# (the client registry) is deliberately NOT matched and stays tracked.
deploy/*/*DEPLOY*.md
deploy/kcl/KCL-SYNC-DEPLOY.md
deploy/ssl/SCROGGINS-CLONE-DEPLOY.md
deploy/kcl/kcl-sync.ps1
KCL-SYNC-DEPLOY.md
SCROGGINS-CLONE-DEPLOY.md
kcl-sync.ps1
